+        """Return a new Prompt derived from this one with additional filters.
+
+        The supplied mapping extends the current filters and overrides
+        matching names, without changing the original prompt or other
+        derived prompts. Passing ``None`` or an empty mapping retains
+        all current filters.
+
+        Parameters
